{"name": "Stepwell", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stepwell is a puzzle game about building impossible paths. Arrange and overlap tiles to create surprising connections, discover new ways to use each piece, and guide little inhabitants as they rebuild their shattered world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Paradoxical Architecture</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779980/extras/9fa2326a45129ce2e34d43ee36eaba6a.poster.avif?t=1791325483\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779980/extras/9fa2326a45129ce2e34d43ee36eaba6a.webm?t=1791325483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779980/extras/9fa2326a45129ce2e34d43ee36eaba6a.mp4?t=1791325483\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mind-Bending Mechanics:</strong> Place ambiguous cubes, stairways, and mind-bending curves onto a dense hexagonal grid. Overlap tiles to create twisting, multi-layered pathways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779980/extras/6b5ecaabd343ce872397b002ddba620b.poster.avif?t=1791325483\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779980/extras/6b5ecaabd343ce872397b002ddba620b.webm?t=1791325483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779980/extras/6b5ecaabd343ce872397b002ddba620b.mp4?t=1791325483\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Hypnotic Ant Farm:</strong> There is no rush. Take your time in a zen-like puzzle game. Watch as your overlapping structures evolve into a bustling, living colony teeming with color and personality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779980/extras/6a3ad34ef3dfdedb124c70ecf331854c.poster.avif?t=1791325483\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779980/extras/6a3ad34ef3dfdedb124c70ecf331854c.webm?t=1791325483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779980/extras/6a3ad34ef3dfdedb124c70ecf331854c.mp4?t=1791325483\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master Multiple Dimensions:</strong> As the game progresses, you will unlock new building blocks that will be challenging to wrap your mind around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779980/extras/b2012e4816523ee333f1164890c777a7.poster.avif?t=1791325483\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779980/extras/b2012e4816523ee333f1164890c777a7.webm?t=1791325483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779980/extras/b2012e4816523ee333f1164890c777a7.mp4?t=1791325483\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bring a friend:</strong>\u00a0Enjoy the puzzles on your own, or invite friends to join you. Share ideas and build a solution together.</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Stepwell is a puzzle game about building impossible paths. Arrange and overlap tiles to create surprising connections, discover new ways to use each piece, and guide little inhabitants as you rebuild their shattered world.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779980/64e1feec342f6d38c01d34c3da3a9aa74f09010a/header.jpg?t=1791325483", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle", "Colorful", "Logic", "Surreal", "Atmospheric", "Experimental"], "developers": "Jeff Krause, Alex Krause, Tim Fowers, Adrian Graumann", "publishers": "Jeff Krause, Alex Krause, Tim Fowers, Adrian Graumann", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4779980", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "7 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/X3SioJqyrnQ", "first_seen": 1791324000.0, "review_rank": 26}